    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This hybrid outdoor sauna is stylishly designed to make a great impression and to seat three people comfortably. Like all the hybrid variants of our saunas, it features both electric and infrared heaters. Having heaters of both types is superbly beneficial and time-saving. You get to the desired temperature quicker and therefore you can enjoy the effect for longer.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As a&nbsp;<span>Diamond</span> model, this particular sauna is created to bring more exposure and more natural light inside. Besides looking very attractive as a sauna it is also very good at being protected from bad weather such as rain and wind.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Buying this sauna is only a few steps away. The health benefits that saunas bring are immense and through regular use of saunas, you will not only feel healthier but also happier.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A sloped or peaked roof is a personal preference, they do not change the fundamental design much.</span></p>",
